### # 12. AIRPORT TRANSFER LOGIC

## Family
Pre-booked 6-seater SUV/Van; 5 to 6hr from CMB. Space for luggage + stroller + car seats + blankets. Winding roads.

## Honeymoon  
Private sedan + meet & greet + flower garland; Direct to tea estate bungalow with valley view.

## Luxury  
Chauffeured Mercedes/Alphard to Heritage hotel like Heritance Tea Bungalow or Jetwing St. Andrew’s

## Budget  
Train: CMB → Colombo Fort → Kandy → Nanu Oya 6-7hr, $3-$20. Or express bus to Nuwara $4-$5

## Senior  
Private car door-to-door; Minimal walking + driver helps with luggage + heating in car. Avoid train due to cold + crowds

