### # 13. GETTING AROUND

Primary modes:
- TUK-TUK for town
- WALKING around Gregory Lake + Town + Victoria Park
- PRIVATE DRIVER for day trips

Travel-agent interpretation:  
Nuwara Eliya is compact and flat in town but cold. 10min across city centre. Book private car for Horton Plains, Tea Estates, Waterfalls. Trains sell out fast in peak season Dec-Feb + Jul-Aug. Pack a jacket even for short tuk-tuk rides.

